msgid "%(coin)s Address"
msgstr "Alamat %(coin)s"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(coin)s receiving address QR code"
msgstr "%(coin)s menerima alamat QR kode"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s is outside your jurisdiction. Sucks to be you."
msgstr "%(company)s berada di luar yurisdiksi Anda. Menyebalkan menjadi dirimu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s is, always has been, and always will be 100%% outside your jurisdiction. You must obtain legal process that is valid in the state of New Hampshire. Then, submit your United States legal process document to our [legal requests portal](/legal)."
msgstr "%(company)s adalah, selalu telah, dan akan selalu 100 %% di luar yurisdiksi Anda. Anda harus mendapatkan proses hukum yang valid di negara bagian New Hampshire. Kemudian, kirimkan dokumen proses hukum Amerika Serikat Anda ke portal [permintaan hukum] (/legal)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(company)s may revoke your License at any time and for any reason."
msgstr "%(company)s mungkin mencabut Lisensi Anda setiap saat dan untuk alasan apapun."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(curation)s: a public curation, by its name or the short name under it. Search %(curation)s to find them; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> narrows a post search to that curation's guilds and accounts. Private curations are never found."
msgstr "%(curation)s: a public curated feed, by its name or the short name under it. Cari %(curation)s untuk menemukan mereka; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> Mempersempit pencarian posting untuk yang curated feed 's guids dan account. Kurator pribadi feed tidak pernah ditemukan."

